 col←readStringElements(data count);a;b;l
⍝ Read VARCHAR/string elements from memory
⍝ data: pointer to string data
⍝ count: number of strings
⍝ Returns: vector of strings

⎕io←0

a←count read.string data
col←1⊃¨a

⍝ Handle short strings (inline, ≤12 bytes)
b←13>l←,⊃¨a
(b/col)←(b/l)↑¨b/col

⍝ Handle long strings (pointer-based, >12 bytes)
b←~b
:If 1∊b
    (b/col)←(b/l){⍺ read.utf8_l 256⊥⌽4↓1⊃⍵}¨b/a
:EndIf

⍝ Decode UTF-8 for short strings (do NOT use monadic ⎕UCS — breaks multi-byte)
:Trap 0
    ((~b)/col)←'UTF-8'∘⎕UCS¨(~b)/col
:Else
:EndTrap

